    "Released open descriptions rose from 3/24 full matches to 6/24, all six concerning capitals or diets. Topic matches do not validate unsupported elaboration.",
    "Both methods met the descriptive strong-learning rule in 23/24 trajectories after 100 B updates. Fresh recognition was 9/23 in this subset; poor task recognition often persists despite learning."
